# Software Should be Written by Writers.

**Authors:** Sheridan, James

## Abstract
Considering the computer as a collaborator rather than a machine, it is encouraged that those in the humanities and the arts fields take advantage of the great potential that artificial intelligence can offer. Stresses that unless deliberately restricted, the computer is an inherently interdisciplinary medium, and capable of interacting with any situation. (SL)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ298269

